  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCJP Zimbabwe Bi-Elections Monitoring</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant will enable the Catholic Commission for Justice and Peace in Zimbabwe (CCJPZ) to monitor bi-elections in 14 constituencies of Zimbabwe. The constituencies fell vacant when the Morgan Tsvangirai led Movement for Democratic Change (MDC-T) recalled 21 legislators from parliament. The bi-elections will be held on 10 June 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
